sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist / Admin
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant DSPA as DSPAReconciler<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant Manifestival as Manifestival Engine<br/>(template renderer)
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Metrics as Metrics Service<br/>8080/TCP TLS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>(ServiceMonitor)
    participant MLflow as MLflow CRs<br/>(mlflow.opendatahub.io)
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>(serving.kserve.io)
    participant Ray as Ray / CodeFlare

    Note over User,Ray: Reconciliation Flow

    User->>K8s: kubectl apply DSPA CR
    K8s->>DSPA: Watch event: DSPA created/updated
    DSPA->>K8s: Read DSPA spec<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    DSPA->>K8s: Read referenced Secrets/ConfigMaps<br/>(DB & storage credentials)
    DSPA->>Manifestival: Render templates from<br/>config/internal/
    Manifestival-->>DSPA: Kubernetes manifests<br/>(with dsp-version label)
    DSPA->>K8s: Apply Deployments<br/>(API Server, Persistence Agent,<br/>Scheduled Workflow, Argo Engine)
    DSPA->>K8s: Apply Services, Routes,<br/>NetworkPolicies, RBAC
    DSPA->>K8s: Apply PVCs, ConfigMaps,<br/>ServiceAccounts
    K8s-->>DSPA: Resource status

    Note over User,Ray: Webhook Flow

    User->>K8s: Create/Update PipelineVersion
    K8s->>Webhook: Validation/Mutation webhook<br/>9443/TCP TLS (OpenShift profile)
    Webhook-->>K8s: Admit/Reject
    K8s-->>User: Result

    Note over User,Ray: Platform Integration Flows

    DSPA->>K8s: Watch MLflow CRs<br/>(bypass client cache)
    K8s-->>DSPA: MLflow instance state
    DSPA->>K8s: Watch KServe InferenceServices
    K8s-->>DSPA: Model serving state
    DSPA->>K8s: CRUD Ray clusters/jobs,<br/>CodeFlare AppWrappers
    DSPA->>K8s: CRUD Seldon deployments

    Note over User,Ray: Observability Flow

    Prometheus->>Metrics: Scrape metrics<br/>8080/TCP TLS (OpenShift profile)
    Metrics-->>Prometheus: Operator metrics
    Note right of Metrics: Health: :8081/healthz (no auth)<br/>Ready: :8081/readyz (no auth)
